From: Tron <tron@tsmconsultz.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 02:51:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] feat(hotelops): add Business Impact Delta to strategist
 page

Adds a No-Action / With-Action exposure projection section using the
shared TSMBNCAExposureEngine (same engine as Insurance/RE/Healthcare/
BPO/FinOps). Base exposure comes from the real OTA overcharge figure
already surfaced in the KPI row (fin.ota_overcharge_period). Severity
and the deadline window are both derived from real per-record signals
already computed by fireCapabilitySweep_HotelOps (worst compliance due
date, worst maintenance SLA breach) rather than invented.

Honesty pattern: if there's no quantifiable OTA overcharge exposure in
the relay, shows 'No quantifiable OTA overcharge exposure reported'
instead of a fabricated $0 delta.
